Project Commands: VendorPulse
1. Start Docker Infrastructure:

  • Open WSL: `wsl -d Ubuntu`

  • Navigate to project: `cd ~/projects/vendorpulse`

  • Run: `docker compose up -d`

2. Backend (Laravel):

  • In VS Code terminal: `php artisan serve`

3. Frontend (Web Dashboard):

  • In dashboard directory: `npm run dev`